# /etc/systemd/system/atlas-aegis.timer — AEGIS nightly at 02:30 local time (Section 9.5 "Nightly automatic").
# Installed verbatim by phase2/07-restic.sh. Persistent=true runs a missed night at the next boot.
[Unit]
Description=Run the AEGIS restic backup nightly

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 02:30:00
RandomizedDelaySec=10min
Persistent=true
Unit=atlas-aegis.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
